   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Read the group chat.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Arya:</b> Shall we go to the climbing wall on Sunday? 🧗</div>\n<div><b>Polat:</b> I’d love to, but I’m afraid of heights. How about the cinema instead?</div>\n<div><b>Arya:</b> The cinema again? We went there last week.</div>\n<div><b>Duygu:</b> What about the trampoline park? It’s fun and it isn’t high at all.</div>\n<div><b>Polat:</b> Great idea! Count me in.</div>\n<div><b>Arya:</b> OK, I don’t mind. Let’s meet at 2 p.m.</div></div>\n<p>Which of the following is TRUE according to the chat?</p>",
