   "q": "<p>Yağız’s mum told him the house rules.</p>\n<div class=\"box\">“You have to tidy your room at weekends. You can’t play computer games from Monday to Thursday. You must be home before 8 p.m. You don’t have to help with the cooking, but you must lay the table.”</div>\n<p>According to the rules, which of the following is TRUE?</p>",
