   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>50 teenagers answered an online survey about four activities. Look at the results.</p>\n<table><tr><th>Activity</th><th>I love it</th><th>I don’t mind it</th><th>I hate it</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Camping</td><td>22</td><td>18</td><td>10</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Shopping</td><td>15</td><td>15</td><td>20</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Gaming</td><td>30</td><td>12</td><td>8</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Visiting museums</td><td>9</td><td>21</td><td>20</td></tr></table>\n<p>Which of the following is TRUE according to the survey?</p>",
