   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Ada:</b> Which do you prefer, watching football matches on TV or at the stadium?</div>\n<div><b>Ozan:</b> (1) ---- . The atmosphere there is incredible!</div>\n<div><b>Ada:</b> Really? I find stadiums too crowded and noisy.</div>\n<div><b>Ozan:</b> (2) ---- . Shouting with thousands of fans is the best part!</div></div>\n<p>Which of the following best completes the dialogue?</p>",
