   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Read the text from a teen magazine.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><b>YOUNG STARS: LARA (14)</b><br>Lara has a cooking channel. She uploads a new video every Wednesday and Saturday. “Filming is exhausting, but editing is my favourite part,” she says. She doesn’t like reading the comments because some of them are rude. Her older sister helps her with the camera, but Lara writes all the recipes herself.</div>\n<p>Which of the following is TRUE about Lara?</p>",
